.TH VELTOS-MAPS 1 "October 2026" "VeltOS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
veltos-maps \- browse Google Maps in a VeltOS window
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B veltos-maps
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens the public Google Maps website in a VeltOS window.
Searches are sent to Google and an internet connection is required.
No Google Maps Platform API key is used.
.PP
Location access is disabled by default. The location switch in this
application and in VeltOS Settings controls whether this application grants
Google Maps' geolocation requests. When enabled, GeoClue may send nearby
Wi-Fi information to Mozilla Location Service to estimate the device's
position.
